  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/badges/label/lieon-studios-creation.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-stick-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/badges/label/requires/mstv.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.lieonlion.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Tool-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <sup><img width=\"5\" height=\"8\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/separator_v.svg\"> pnku:</sup> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pnku.de%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/pnku_de_logo.svg\" alt=\"pnku.de\"></a> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/desc_hr_top.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>Больше вариантов инструментов</h1>\n<p>Работа с дубовыми инструментами уже надоела? Другие деревья заслуживают немного внимания, не так ли?<br>\nАбсолютно!</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Tool-Variants/pres/cf_desc_banner.webp\" alt=\"\"> Подборка недавно добавленных инструментов, использующих '<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-tool-variants/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Armor Stand Variants</a>' и '<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farmor-stands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Armor Stands</a>' (для расстановки) от <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fRoundaround\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">roundaround</a>.</p>\n<h2>Добавление 101 новой <em>лопаты</em>, 101 новой <em>кирки</em>, 101 нового <em>топора</em>, 101 новой <em>мотыги</em> и 11 новых <em>кисточек</em> в Minecraft.</h2>\n<h3>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/v1115.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;Текстура Бледного дуба &amp; <img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/gku5m.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;Медные текстуры от <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fhunnycakehorse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><em>hunnycakehorse</em></strong></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/desc_hr_bottom.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>",
